mlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-terminal w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 19h8\"></path><path d=\"m4 17 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold\">System Initialized</span></div><h1 class=\"text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight\">Crawler <span class=\"text-blue-500\">Stress Test</span> Ground</h1><p class=\"text-slate-400 text-base md:text-lg max-w-2xl leading-relaxed\">Welcome to the high-fidelity benchmarking environment. This platform is engineered with intentional architectural flaws and modern web traps to push headless browsers to their absolute operational limits.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-4 pt-4\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-blue-600 text-white font-semibold hover:bg-blue-500 transition-all shadow-lg shadow-blue-600/20 group\" href=\"/test/media\">Launch Testing <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 font-semibold hover:bg-slate-700 transition-all border border-slate-700\" href=\"/sitemap.xml\">View Sitemap.xml</a></div></div></section><section class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6\"><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#0f0f12] border border-slate-800 hover:border-slate-700 transition-colors group\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><p class=\"text-slate-500 text-sm font-medium mb-2\">Crawl Success Rate</p><div class=\"flex items-end justify-between\"><span class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-green-400\">94.2%</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check lucide-check-circle-2 w-5 h-5 text-green-500 mb-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#0f0f12] border border-slate-800 hover:border-slate-700 transition-colors group\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><p class=\"text-slate-500 text-sm font-medium mb-2\">Detection Latency</p><div class=\"flex items-end justify-between\"><span class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-blue-400\">12ms</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check lucide-check-circle-2 w-5 h-5 text-green-500 mb-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#0f0f12] border border-slate-800 hover:border-slate-700 transition-colors group\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><p class=\"text-slate-500 text-sm font-medium mb-2\">WAF Triggered</p><div class=\"flex items-end justify-between\"><span class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-yellow-400\">1,204</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-triangle-alert lucide-alert-triangle w-5 h-5 text-yellow-500 mb-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0